meta {
  name: Fetch jobs (public)
  type: http
  seq: 1
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/jobs?page=1&size=10&sort=createdAt,desc&filter=active : true and employmentType in ['FULL_TIME'] and workMode in ['REMOTE','HYBRID']&filter=salary >: 10000000 and salary <: 20000000
  body: none
  auth: none
}

params:query {
  page: 1
  size: 10
  sort: createdAt,desc
  ~filter: active : true and employmentType in ['FULL_TIME'] and workMode in ['REMOTE','HYBRID']
  ~filter: salary >: 10000000 and salary <: 20000000
}

docs {
  Filters use spring-filter syntax. New fields: employmentType (FULL_TIME|PART_TIME|CONTRACT|INTERNSHIP), workMode (ONSITE|REMOTE|HYBRID). Salary overlap filter: (salary > 0 or salaryMax > 0) and salary <: 50000000 and (salaryMax is null or salaryMax >: 20000000). Send sort=pinnedUntil,desc first (then your own sort) to list pinned jobs on top; posts of companies that are not approved are not listed.
}
